<title>SINGAPORE: Clipsal increases stake in subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Clipsal increases stake in subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrical fittings firm Clipsal Industries (Holdings) Ltd said on Monday it had raised its investment in a Malaysian subsidiary from 2.0 ringgit to 12 million ringgit.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it had subscribed for an additional 11,999,998 ordinary shares of 1.0 ringgit each at par for cash in Huge Eastern Sdn Bhd.</p>
<p>It said the investment would be funded by the capitalisation of a similar amount owed by this subsidiary to the company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
